  "kind": "definition",
  "title": "Flasque sheaves on the Zariski site",
  "statement": "An abelian sheaf $F$ on a topological space $X$ is\n*flasque* if $F(V)\\to F(U)$ is surjective for every\ninclusion of open subsets $U\\subset V\\subset X$.",
